WEBVTT

00:00:02.280 --> 00:00:04.610
Sakura Hane, on the skinny!

00:00:04.610 --> 00:00:05.840
Here I go!

00:00:06.390 --> 00:00:10.050
Hane-chan, do you remember the
important things you need while riding a skinny?

00:00:10.050 --> 00:00:10.920
Um...

00:00:10.920 --> 00:00:14.560
Rear brakes, half-clutch,
and what else?

00:00:14.560 --> 00:00:16.870
Your knee grip and your vision.

00:00:16.870 --> 00:00:18.390
You can't look down.

00:00:18.690 --> 00:00:20.980
Look far ahead.

00:00:24.920 --> 00:00:26.520
Hah!

00:00:52.690 --> 00:00:56.240
この坂を上り切ったら
kono saka o noborikittara

00:00:56.240 --> 00:01:00.200
必ず見える景色が好きだって
kanarazu mieru keshiki ga suki datte

00:01:00.200 --> 00:01:00.240
必ず見える景色が好きだって

00:01:00.240 --> 00:01:06.370
背中に羽を持つあの子も言って笑ってた
senaka ni hane o motsu ano ko mo itte waratteta

00:01:06.790 --> 00:01:10.040
ドキドキが一瞬で
dokidoki ga isshun de

00:01:10.040 --> 00:01:14.130
トキメキになっていくんだなんて
tokimeki ni natteikunda nante

00:01:14.130 --> 00:01:17.840
あの頃は信じられなくて
ano koro wa shinjirarenakute

00:01:17.840 --> 00:01:22.810
ただ見惚れていたよ
tada mitoreteita yo

00:01:23.270 --> 00:01:27.440
このスピードに乗せた体温が
kono supiido ni noseta taion ga

00:01:27.440 --> 00:01:31.190
今全身で伝う　通じ合う
ima zenshin de tsutau tsuujiau

00:01:31.190 --> 00:01:34.820
物語の鍵はこの手に
monogatari no kagi wa kono te ni

00:01:34.820 --> 00:01:38.320
ぎゅっと強く握っているから
gyutto tsuyoku nigitteiru kara

00:01:38.320 --> 00:01:42.040
感じて　応えて　風になる
kanjite kotaete kaze ni naru

00:01:42.040 --> 00:01:45.710
空に溶けて海を抱きしめる
sora ni tokete umi o dakishimeru

00:01:45.960 --> 00:01:49.630
新しい世界が見えるはず
atarashii sekai ga mieru hazu

00:01:49.920 --> 00:01:56.720
さぁ確かめに行ってみよう
saa tashikame ni ittemiyou

00:02:07.560 --> 00:02:10.650
School!!
Episode 2

00:02:10.650 --> 00:02:12.440
Look look, Papa, there's giraffes!
School!!
Episode 2

00:02:12.440 --> 00:02:12.940
Look look, Papa, there's giraffes!

00:02:13.570 --> 00:02:16.780
Wow, they have really long necks!!

00:02:17.240 --> 00:02:19.410
Rin, do you like giraffes?

00:02:19.410 --> 00:02:20.370
Yup!

00:02:20.820 --> 00:02:24.660
Hey Papa, what crying sound does a giraffe make?

00:02:25.910 --> 00:02:29.580
Rin, Giraffes don't <i>actually</i> cry out.

00:02:29.870 --> 00:02:31.130
Why not?

00:02:31.130 --> 00:02:34.750
Did you know, Giraffes are very strong.

00:02:36.960 --> 00:02:39.380
Hey, Rin, have you noticed?

00:02:39.380 --> 00:02:41.680
There's a giraffe in you too.

00:02:42.800 --> 00:02:44.260
Suzunoki Rin.

00:02:44.600 --> 00:02:46.680
TL Note: Kirin means giraffe
Suzuno-<i>kirin</i>. Get it?

00:02:47.680 --> 00:02:48.850
You're right!

00:02:49.190 --> 00:02:53.020
So you've gotta be strong just like a giraffe!

00:02:53.520 --> 00:02:56.320
Be a strong girl that doesn't cry.

00:02:56.320 --> 00:02:57.190
Yeah!

00:02:59.110 --> 00:03:03.830
Daddy failed his 1000CC bike exam again.

00:03:03.830 --> 00:03:05.540
It's tough, right?

00:03:05.540 --> 00:03:10.210
There's people who pay money
to get their licenses.

00:03:10.210 --> 00:03:13.250
But those aren't <i>real</i> licenses!

00:03:13.540 --> 00:03:17.130
Daddy wants to get a <i>real</i> license to ride

00:03:17.130 --> 00:03:19.340
a Katana, a <i>real</i> big bike.

00:03:19.630 --> 00:03:22.840
Not this 400CC knock-off.

00:03:22.840 --> 00:03:23.800
Oh...

00:03:24.550 --> 00:03:25.300
This time..

00:03:26.140 --> 00:03:29.600
a company called "<i>Yoshimura</i>" will be selling

00:03:30.020 --> 00:03:32.900
a custom tuned 1135R, the ultimate Katana.

00:03:33.600 --> 00:03:37.230
Then, all you need to do is get your
motorcycle license so you can buy it, right?

00:03:37.230 --> 00:03:38.610
By the way...

00:03:38.990 --> 00:03:42.320
To buy that bike, you need to write an essay.

00:03:42.320 --> 00:03:43.610
An essay?

00:03:43.610 --> 00:03:44.570
Yup.

00:03:44.570 --> 00:03:46.870
They'll only sell the bike

00:03:46.870 --> 00:03:49.790
to the people who can show their passion

00:03:49.790 --> 00:03:52.420
for the 1135R in your essay.

00:03:56.630 --> 00:03:59.130
Papa, you don't need to push yourself.

00:04:00.090 --> 00:04:02.930
I love this Katana.

00:04:03.510 --> 00:04:06.800
It's cool, and I get to
travel with Papa on it.

00:04:06.800 --> 00:04:08.680
It's fine if its a knock-off.

00:04:09.060 --> 00:04:11.560
This is Rin's favorite bike!

00:04:12.810 --> 00:04:13.940
Rin...

00:04:14.310 --> 00:04:17.190
I can even sing the Katana song!

00:04:17.480 --> 00:04:20.150
Katana, Katana, Katana!

00:04:20.150 --> 00:04:22.200
I'm riding a Katana!

00:04:22.200 --> 00:04:23.400
Hey, don't shake the bike.
I'm riding a Katana!

00:04:23.400 --> 00:04:24.780
My head, my head, my head...
Hey, don't shake the bike.

00:04:24.780 --> 00:04:26.370
My head, my head, my head...

00:04:26.370 --> 00:04:28.030
My head feels funn—

00:04:34.460 --> 00:04:35.120
Papa?

00:04:47.390 --> 00:04:49.220
Hakuon General Hospital

00:04:50.560 --> 00:04:54.520
Rin, your dad's hurt real bad.

00:04:55.060 --> 00:04:59.770
I should've bought my
license at driving school.

00:04:59.770 --> 00:05:01.440
Papa, hang in there!

00:05:02.940 --> 00:05:08.740
Just once would've been ok, but I
really wanted to ride the <i>Yoshimura</i> Katana 1135R.

00:05:10.200 --> 00:05:11.450
Just wait, Papa.

00:05:11.450 --> 00:05:13.080
I'll make sure you ride it!

00:05:13.370 --> 00:05:16.080
I'll write that essay...

00:05:16.370 --> 00:05:19.500
and I <i>will</i> give you the
chance to ride a <i>Yoshimura</i> Katana!

00:05:21.630 --> 00:05:24.800
"I love the Katana.

00:05:25.170 --> 00:05:28.300
I think it's the coolest
bike in the universe.

00:05:28.720 --> 00:05:31.760
I also love Suzuki for making the Katana.

00:05:32.180 --> 00:05:37.060
I think every bike in the world should be a Suzuki.

00:05:37.770 --> 00:05:40.940
When I turn 16,

00:05:41.320 --> 00:05:44.900
I want to get a motorcycle
license and ride the Katana.

00:05:45.570 --> 00:05:49.570
And then, I will ride the
Katana for the rest of my life"

00:05:50.160 --> 00:05:51.950
Daddy, I finished the essay!

00:05:56.370 --> 00:05:57.460
Papa...

00:06:00.130 --> 00:06:02.710
Giraffes don't cry.

00:06:20.650 --> 00:06:23.860
The first time going to school
on Papa's Katana.

00:06:28.070 --> 00:06:31.570
Rin, why are you riding that fake Katana?

00:06:31.870 --> 00:06:32.740
Papa?

00:06:33.080 --> 00:06:35.450
It's not a Katana unless it's big!

00:06:35.450 --> 00:06:39.920
And this <i>Yoshimura</i> Katana 1135R is the best!

00:06:42.340 --> 00:06:46.960
Who do you think wrote the essay
to get you your bike, you stupid dad!!

00:06:48.380 --> 00:06:50.640
Suzunoki got her bike license?

00:06:50.640 --> 00:06:53.510
Yeah. She was super happy.

00:06:53.510 --> 00:06:56.890
She said she'd ride her motorcycle
to school from now on.

00:06:56.890 --> 00:06:58.390
Yeah?

00:06:58.390 --> 00:07:02.020
If only I knew what bike she had

00:07:02.020 --> 00:07:04.730
I could get her to join the Bike club...

00:07:05.020 --> 00:07:07.690
Although Suzunoki hates me...

00:07:07.990 --> 00:07:09.740
Since I'm prejudiced against Suzuki.

00:07:09.900 --> 00:07:15.280
Afterall, the stuff you say is so
complicated it's confusing...

00:07:15.660 --> 00:07:16.660
Morning.

00:07:17.450 --> 00:07:19.330
Rin-chan, morning.

00:07:19.330 --> 00:07:20.370
Morning.

00:07:23.000 --> 00:07:24.170
I'll go talk to her for a bit.

00:07:25.420 --> 00:07:27.760
C-Congrats, Suzunoki.

00:07:27.760 --> 00:07:29.510
I hear you got your license.

00:07:30.170 --> 00:07:32.180
With that, now we're rider pals.

00:07:32.180 --> 00:07:33.930
From now on, can I call you "Rin"?

00:07:35.550 --> 00:07:36.430
That's fine.

00:07:37.680 --> 00:07:40.940
And from now on, I'll call you "Shaggy", 'k?

00:07:44.230 --> 00:07:45.480
How'd it go?

00:07:47.070 --> 00:07:49.360
Listen, you gotta praise her bike

00:07:49.360 --> 00:07:51.070
even if it's a lie, praise it!!

00:07:51.070 --> 00:07:54.700
Even if it's a scooter with anime stickers
all over it, you gotta praise it!!

00:07:54.820 --> 00:07:56.450
Ehh? Why?

00:07:56.450 --> 00:07:58.290
Because otherwise, she'll kill me!!

00:07:58.290 --> 00:07:58.990
If I lie, Yume will scold me.

00:07:58.990 --> 00:08:01.040
Suzuki-hating facist.
If I lie, Yume will scold me.

00:08:01.040 --> 00:08:01.500
Just do it!!
Suzuki-hating facist.

00:08:01.500 --> 00:08:01.910
Just do it!!

00:08:05.960 --> 00:08:09.000
Hane, wanna look at my bike?

00:08:09.000 --> 00:08:12.130
I have duties today.
So can I come later?

00:08:16.680 --> 00:08:18.140
Hey, Rin-chan.

00:08:19.100 --> 00:08:19.720
What?

00:08:20.220 --> 00:08:24.060
I think you're mistaken
about Onsa-chan.

00:08:24.350 --> 00:08:25.440
What do you mean by that?

00:08:25.440 --> 00:08:25.900
Wah!
What do you mean by that?

00:08:27.650 --> 00:08:29.650
Onsa-chan is a really nice girl.

00:08:30.480 --> 00:08:34.360
She just wants to be friends
with a fellow rider pal.

00:08:36.700 --> 00:08:40.700
Your bike is the coolest bike
in the whole universe, right?

00:08:41.040 --> 00:08:42.750
I can't wait.

00:08:43.710 --> 00:08:44.960
What's wrong, Rin-chan?

00:08:44.960 --> 00:08:45.880
Shh!

00:08:46.750 --> 00:08:47.840
I never would've guessed

00:08:48.290 --> 00:08:51.880
Rin's machine would be a 400CC Katana.

00:08:52.470 --> 00:08:54.840
It hurts to say, but she's done us.

00:08:55.130 --> 00:08:57.720
This bike is what every biker longs for.

00:08:59.470 --> 00:09:03.680
The revival of the famous
1100CC Katana's classic style.

00:09:04.270 --> 00:09:06.600
With a high-performance liquid-cooled engine.

00:09:06.980 --> 00:09:10.980
The polish that comes with
being the latest in the Katana family.

00:09:11.440 --> 00:09:13.690
It wouldn't be an overstatement to say that

00:09:13.690 --> 00:09:15.820
the 400 Katana is actually the true Katana!!

00:09:20.030 --> 00:09:23.080
I had you wrong, Shaggy.

00:09:23.950 --> 00:09:25.040
You're...

00:09:25.580 --> 00:09:27.210
You're actually...

00:09:27.210 --> 00:09:28.500
Yeah, right!

00:09:28.500 --> 00:09:30.500
How was that? Was it perfect?

00:09:31.630 --> 00:09:35.590
I gotta practice, cause it's
so hard to compliment this thing.

00:09:35.590 --> 00:09:37.050
What are you gonna say, Stig?

00:09:38.550 --> 00:09:39.470
Su
zu
ki
Well,
it <i>
is</i>
a

00:09:39.470 --> 00:09:41.390
Hahahaha
That's not praise at all!

00:09:41.390 --> 00:09:45.100
Man, you just can't find anything
good to say about the 400CC Katana.

00:09:45.100 --> 00:09:48.230
The fact that the only praise-able thing

00:09:48.230 --> 00:09:50.310
is that it looks like the 1100 Katana is sad.

00:09:54.860 --> 00:09:57.910
W-Wait, Rin! We can talk this over!

00:10:08.290 --> 00:10:11.590
The first blood my Katana takes,

00:10:13.710 --> 00:10:16.550
is gonna be yours, Shaggy!

00:10:18.760 --> 00:10:20.890
This bike's so cool.

00:10:22.510 --> 00:10:24.770
Hane, what'd you just say?

00:10:25.060 --> 00:10:28.140
I said this bike's really cool!

00:10:28.140 --> 00:10:32.190
You don't have to tell lies
to save that Shaggy over there.

00:10:32.190 --> 00:10:33.940
I ain't lying!

00:10:34.730 --> 00:10:37.780
Rin-chan, your bike is so cool!

00:10:48.750 --> 00:10:51.580
Giraffes don't cry.

00:10:51.580 --> 00:10:54.920
What's wrong, Rin-chan?
Does your stomach hurt?

00:10:57.720 --> 00:11:00.470
Let's not invite her to the Bike Club.

00:11:01.430 --> 00:11:06.970
Bakuo<i>n!!</i>

00:11:07.980 --> 00:11:09.690
So, when I started driving

00:11:09.690 --> 00:11:12.400
this Yamaha Jog challenged me.

00:11:12.690 --> 00:11:13.900
What an idiot, right?

00:11:13.980 --> 00:11:18.490
There's no way a 50CC
can keep up with my Katana.

00:11:18.650 --> 00:11:20.450
They were probably so jealous,

00:11:20.450 --> 00:11:23.120
that they couldn't help but to challenge me.

00:11:23.410 --> 00:11:25.330
Afterall, my Katana is...

00:11:25.330 --> 00:11:26.540
Ready? And...

00:11:26.540 --> 00:11:28.410
It's so cool!

00:11:28.410 --> 00:11:30.160
Yes, exactly!

00:11:30.460 --> 00:11:34.460
Rin, why are you here if you're not in the club?

00:11:34.460 --> 00:11:37.090
Are you here <i>just</i> to make Hane say that?

00:11:37.460 --> 00:11:40.760
What if I am? It's the truth.

00:11:40.760 --> 00:11:44.390
Besides, it's not like you don't
make Hane say those things.

00:11:44.390 --> 00:11:46.930
What did you say? They're not weird!

00:11:46.930 --> 00:11:49.430
Everything I say is truth!

00:11:49.430 --> 00:11:50.730
Are you sure?

00:11:51.230 --> 00:11:53.480
Fine, you wanna settle this?

00:11:53.480 --> 00:11:56.610
Bike Club!!

00:11:57.320 --> 00:12:00.150
Dream as though you'll live forever.

00:12:00.820 --> 00:12:03.610
Live as though you'll die today.

00:12:04.160 --> 00:12:07.660
Let's end this with sumo.

00:12:07.660 --> 00:12:07.950
Fine! I'll show you!

00:12:07.950 --> 00:12:09.700
Who are ya?
Fine! I'll show you!

00:12:09.700 --> 00:12:12.790
Thou may call me Minowa Hijiri, of the class 1-B.

00:12:13.370 --> 00:12:16.090
I ask thou to allow me to join the Bike club.

00:12:17.000 --> 00:12:18.750
Still in it! Still in it!

00:12:21.630 --> 00:12:23.880
It would seem they are occupied.

00:12:23.880 --> 00:12:26.430
It's okay, it's always like this.

00:12:27.050 --> 00:12:29.220
They both love motorcycles,

00:12:29.220 --> 00:12:31.480
yet somehow, they always fight.

00:12:31.730 --> 00:12:35.400
Oh? Throwing fists? That sounds so naughty!

00:12:35.730 --> 00:12:36.650
Naughty?

00:12:36.650 --> 00:12:39.150
However, since they ride motorcycles,

00:12:39.150 --> 00:12:43.200
I thought that they'd have these "chicken race"

00:12:43.820 --> 00:12:45.360
What's a "chicken race"?

00:12:45.360 --> 00:12:49.410
Oh, have you not seen the film "Rebel without a cause"?

00:12:49.950 --> 00:12:53.160
It's where machines drive toward a wall or cliff.

00:12:53.160 --> 00:12:55.870
And the first one to brake loses the race.

00:12:55.870 --> 00:12:57.840
Tis' a test of their courage.

00:12:58.500 --> 00:13:01.090
They do something crazy
like that with their own bikes?

00:13:01.090 --> 00:13:02.970
It may seem pointless indeed.

00:13:03.920 --> 00:13:06.760
But the purpose for this pointless task

00:13:06.760 --> 00:13:10.760
is to be recognized for your courage.

00:13:11.060 --> 00:13:13.810
And something that may be called "friendship"

00:13:13.810 --> 00:13:16.400
can blossom between the competitors.

00:13:17.690 --> 00:13:18.980
Friendship...

00:13:19.020 --> 00:13:19.650
Bike Club!!

00:13:19.650 --> 00:13:20.980
I see.
Bike Club!!

00:13:20.980 --> 00:13:21.030
That's it!
Bike Club!!

00:13:21.030 --> 00:13:22.400
That's it!

00:13:22.400 --> 00:13:25.240
That's exactly what we need!!

00:13:25.820 --> 00:13:27.490
Chicken Race?!

00:13:27.490 --> 00:13:29.780
Yeah! Let's all do it!

00:13:29.780 --> 00:13:32.950
No way. I don't wanna do that to my Katana

00:13:33.790 --> 00:13:35.160
You <i>chicken</i>?

00:13:36.210 --> 00:13:39.670
So you're trying to quit and
blame it all on me, right?

00:13:39.670 --> 00:13:41.460
Let's just end this now!

00:13:41.460 --> 00:13:43.210
Bring it on!

00:13:44.340 --> 00:13:46.260
What's this?!

00:13:46.840 --> 00:13:50.510
There's a second seat next to the motorcycle!

00:13:50.510 --> 00:13:52.930
It's called a sidecar.

00:13:53.560 --> 00:13:56.310
And a Ducati of all things...

00:13:56.310 --> 00:14:01.360
And to add to that
rare 750SS Imola Replica...

00:14:01.610 --> 00:14:05.030
My apologies, but I do not have my license yet.

00:14:05.400 --> 00:14:09.320
So, my butler, Hayakawa, will be the driver, as he

00:14:09.320 --> 00:14:11.240
served in the Minowa family for 4 generations.

00:14:12.910 --> 00:14:16.750
I haven't used a sidecar since the war.

00:14:19.630 --> 00:14:23.460
Eyes burning with passion... along with tense lips...

00:14:23.460 --> 00:14:26.170
I can clearly see you have experience.

00:14:27.170 --> 00:14:30.890
I came here expecting high school girls

00:14:30.890 --> 00:14:33.970
but it would seem that I must fight seriously.

00:14:55.410 --> 00:14:56.370
Ready...

00:14:56.830 --> 00:14:58.120
Go!

00:15:00.620 --> 00:15:02.750
I'm goin' til my engine burns out!

00:15:02.750 --> 00:15:04.380
My Katana won't lose!!

00:15:14.100 --> 00:15:16.310
Well, our bikes are important...

00:15:16.850 --> 00:15:18.730
They both stopped at the same time!

00:15:19.230 --> 00:15:22.400
I guess they really get along!

00:15:22.400 --> 00:15:25.070
Stig, you can stop now.

00:15:25.860 --> 00:15:26.940
Stig?

00:15:30.900 --> 00:15:33.910
Hayakawa, you mustn't hit the brakes.

00:15:33.910 --> 00:15:34.740
Indeed.

00:15:35.080 --> 00:15:36.740
I do not intend to lose.

00:15:38.750 --> 00:15:43.540
Hyaaaaaahh!

00:15:58.850 --> 00:16:00.020
Hayakawa...

00:16:00.310 --> 00:16:02.440
Yes, Hijiri-Ojousama?

00:16:03.350 --> 00:16:07.110
I'm a real renegade, right?

00:16:07.440 --> 00:16:09.610
Indeed, you very much are a renegade.

00:16:11.860 --> 00:16:13.780
So this is what it means to be a rebel?

00:16:13.780 --> 00:16:15.410
It's awesome!

00:16:26.040 --> 00:16:27.130
I see.

00:16:27.130 --> 00:16:30.300
Your lessons are over now, huh?

00:16:30.300 --> 00:16:32.220
Time goes by so fast.

00:16:32.840 --> 00:16:36.640
But I'm sure you'll make it through the
graduation exam just fine, at this rate.

00:16:36.640 --> 00:16:38.760
All thanks to you, Baita!

00:16:39.310 --> 00:16:42.310
I've been wondering, though...

00:16:42.310 --> 00:16:47.360
Why do you have a boy-ish name like
"Baita" even though you sound like a girl?

00:16:48.190 --> 00:16:51.530
I may be a Super Four...

00:16:51.530 --> 00:16:53.360
but I'm built for driving school.

00:16:54.150 --> 00:16:57.820
The fastest you can go at driving
school is 50 kilometers per hour.

00:16:57.820 --> 00:17:00.240
So we training vehicles are made to have

00:17:00.240 --> 00:17:02.580
less power than commercial models.

00:17:03.500 --> 00:17:06.750
They removed my Hyper V-Tech,
too—my defining feature.

00:17:07.250 --> 00:17:09.340
Yes, I was neutered!

00:17:09.630 --> 00:17:10.670
Neutered?

00:17:10.920 --> 00:17:14.680
TL Note: The most progressive anime of all time
I was born a man, but I became a woman!

00:17:14.680 --> 00:17:15.630
Do you understand?

00:17:15.630 --> 00:17:17.090
Kinda.

00:17:17.430 --> 00:17:19.010
Hey, Hane.

00:17:19.970 --> 00:17:21.560
I gotta go now.

00:17:21.560 --> 00:17:23.810
You're right. We'll see each other again.

00:17:23.810 --> 00:17:24.520
Yup.

00:17:24.520 --> 00:17:27.310
Let's ride at the
graduation exam.

00:17:28.020 --> 00:17:29.610
Bye, Baita.

00:17:32.400 --> 00:17:34.320
Goodbye, Hane-chan.

00:17:35.650 --> 00:17:39.320
All right, we got some new
fuel-injected bikes.

00:17:39.320 --> 00:17:41.240
Let's start replacing them.

00:17:50.500 --> 00:17:52.750
Okay, Sakura Hane-san, take Course A.

00:17:52.750 --> 00:17:53.170
Examinee

00:17:53.170 --> 00:17:53.800
Okay!
Examinee

00:17:53.800 --> 00:17:54.460
Examinee

00:17:54.460 --> 00:17:57.300
Let's go, Baita!
Examinee

00:17:57.300 --> 00:17:57.970
Huh?
Examinee

00:17:59.050 --> 00:18:01.220
The color of this engine...

00:18:02.060 --> 00:18:05.600
She's not Baita.

00:18:05.980 --> 00:18:07.810
Is this your first time on the new model?

00:18:08.400 --> 00:18:10.690
Don't worry. It handles just the same.

00:18:10.690 --> 00:18:11.690
Okay.

00:18:13.860 --> 00:18:16.530
I ver much look forward to working
with you today, Outoubai-san.

00:18:19.740 --> 00:18:22.240
This bike doesn't talk!

00:18:22.700 --> 00:18:23.740
Okay, you can begin.

00:18:23.740 --> 00:18:24.660
O-Okay.

00:18:31.710 --> 00:18:35.170
Um... I think I first adjust the mirrors...

00:18:35.670 --> 00:18:39.300
Put the gear to neutral... Start the engine...

00:18:39.680 --> 00:18:42.390
Turn on the blinker, make sure it's safe to go...

00:18:42.390 --> 00:18:44.470
Then shift into first gear,

00:18:45.520 --> 00:18:46.770
and go.

00:18:49.140 --> 00:18:52.650
The engine will stall if you shift
into gear with the stand down.

00:18:56.820 --> 00:18:58.900
She's already off to a bad start.

00:18:58.900 --> 00:19:01.820
And compared to training, she's kinda shaky.

00:19:02.070 --> 00:19:04.160
And she keeps looking down.

00:19:04.160 --> 00:19:06.120
Is she gonna be okay?

00:19:06.620 --> 00:19:09.250
Baita would've told me everything...

00:19:10.920 --> 00:19:12.170
I was supposed to turn!

00:19:12.500 --> 00:19:14.130
Now she went on the wrong course.

00:19:14.130 --> 00:19:16.840
She won't punish her just for that, but...

00:19:17.170 --> 00:19:18.590
She's definitely in trouble.

00:19:18.920 --> 00:19:20.340
I can't do it.

00:19:20.680 --> 00:19:23.680
I can't do it without Baita.

00:19:26.520 --> 00:19:29.560
She almost passed the stop line, just now.

00:19:29.560 --> 00:19:32.480
I'm surprised they haven't
stopped her exam yet.

00:19:32.980 --> 00:19:37.150
I think we should cheer her on somehow.

00:19:37.480 --> 00:19:38.690
Let's go.

00:19:38.990 --> 00:19:40.030
Go?

00:19:40.030 --> 00:19:40.780
Where?

00:19:41.660 --> 00:19:44.910
Hane-chan needs us to help.

00:19:44.910 --> 00:19:46.620
Don't make a big deal out of it.

00:19:46.620 --> 00:19:50.330
If she fails, she can just take the exam again.

00:19:50.330 --> 00:19:52.330
Have you two forgotten?

00:19:52.670 --> 00:19:54.500
The four of us and Hane

00:19:54.500 --> 00:19:57.000
aren't just rider pals.

00:19:57.630 --> 00:20:00.630
We all did the chicken race!

00:20:00.630 --> 00:20:02.430
We're homegirls!

00:20:04.890 --> 00:20:06.220
Baita...

00:20:06.850 --> 00:20:10.020
If I fall off the skinny it's an out, right?

00:20:10.020 --> 00:20:13.440
I think she said something else...

00:20:20.240 --> 00:20:21.360
I-I'm falling!

00:20:22.030 --> 00:20:23.410
Hane-chan!

00:20:25.660 --> 00:20:29.330
Hurray! Hurray! Hane-chan!

00:20:29.620 --> 00:20:30.870
You can do it! You can do it! Hane-chan!

00:20:30.870 --> 00:20:31.370
(homos)
You can do it! You can do it! Hane-chan!

00:20:31.370 --> 00:20:33.250
You can do it! You can do it! Hane-chan!

00:20:34.920 --> 00:20:38.840
You're a girl! Don't spread your legs like that!

00:20:38.840 --> 00:20:41.010
Close your... legs...

00:20:44.090 --> 00:20:45.930
What? I'm ain't falling.

00:20:46.680 --> 00:20:47.850
She's going to make it!

00:20:48.140 --> 00:20:50.720
Us cheering her did the job!

00:20:53.600 --> 00:20:56.190
Baita, I remember now.

00:20:56.190 --> 00:20:58.400
I have to make sure I grip with my knees.

00:20:58.400 --> 00:21:00.650
And I have to not look down.

00:21:01.690 --> 00:21:03.650
I'm gonna be okay.

00:21:03.950 --> 00:21:07.240
If I look ahead, far ahead

00:21:07.740 --> 00:21:09.530
in that distance...

00:21:11.540 --> 00:21:13.500
My friends are there.

00:21:17.040 --> 00:21:18.960
I didn't even pass...

00:21:20.710 --> 00:21:23.010
I will now announce the results.

00:21:23.340 --> 00:21:24.720
Let's see...

00:21:25.010 --> 00:21:27.090
Everyone passed.

00:21:27.090 --> 00:21:28.090
Y...

00:21:28.550 --> 00:21:30.510
Yes!

00:21:31.390 --> 00:21:33.140
Everyone, I did it!

00:21:33.140 --> 00:21:33.600
Isn't that great!
Everyone, I did it!

00:21:33.600 --> 00:21:33.980
Isn't that great!

00:21:34.270 --> 00:21:37.900
You don't need to talk with me anymore,

00:21:38.230 --> 00:21:39.270
Hane-chan.

00:21:39.900 --> 00:21:41.820
What's wrong? Are you crying?

00:21:41.820 --> 00:21:45.570
N-no, you've got it wrong!
It's just sweat!

00:21:46.490 --> 00:21:51.700
Hane-chan is the thousandth rider
whose bike virginity I took.

00:21:51.700 --> 00:21:53.450
Yeah, yeah.

00:21:53.450 --> 00:21:56.080
I'm tired of hearing about your escapades.

00:21:56.080 --> 00:21:57.750
Silly Baita.

